```
Title: Antivirus - Ransomware Signature
Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Arnim Rupp
Date: 2022-05-12
Level: critical
Description: Detects a highly relevant Antivirus alert that reports ransomware.
# This event must not be ignored just because the AV has blocked the malware but investigate, how it came there in the first place.
MITRE Tactic: Impact
Tags: attack.t1486, attack.impact
Reference: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/category/antivirus/av_ransomware.yml
# False Positives:
#   - Unlikely
```
Signature IN ("*Babuk*", "*Babyk*", "*BlackWorm*", "*Chaos*", "*Cobra*", "*ContiCrypt*", "*Crypter*", "*Cryptes*", "*Cryptor*", "*CylanCrypt*", "*DelShad*", "*Destructor*", "*Filecoder*", "*GandCrab*", "*GrandCrab*", "*Haperlock*", "*Hiddentear*", "*HydraCrypt*", "*Krypt*", "*Lockbit*", "*Locker*", "*Mallox*", "*Medusa*", "*Phobos*", "*Ransom*", "*Rook*", "*Ryuk*", "*Ryzerlo*", "*Stopcrypt*", "*Tescrypt*", "*TeslaCrypt*", "*WannaCry*", "*Xorist*")